# orderflow_engine — example env for R7 Telegram alerts (send-only).
# Copy to a real .env (which is gitignored) and fill in. NEVER commit real values.
#
# NAMESPACED on purpose (FOUNDER DECISION 12 Jul): R7 shares the live bot
# (single inbox) but reads ONLY these ORDERFLOW_* names — never the live
# system's bare TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN, and with NO fallback — so sourcing
# backend/.env in a shell can never leak the live token into R7. The founder
# places the (shared) token under these names deliberately. Alerts also
# require alerts.enabled=true in tape_config.yaml before anything is sent.

ORDERFLOW_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
ORDERFLOW_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
